    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Prospector is an <strong>incremental bullet hell </strong>about mining cofferoids and fighting the evil SpaceCorp. <strong>Collect</strong> resources, <strong>upgrade</strong> your ship and <strong>become</strong> unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine cofferoids from SpaceCorp's fields and steal their AstroCoffee seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/d50ec75ae6be3a923fdb727ccab4c542.poster.avif?t=1755502708\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/d50ec75ae6be3a923fdb727ccab4c542.webm?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/d50ec75ae6be3a923fdb727ccab4c542.mp4?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and upgrade the skill tree to increase your ship power.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/7728db54bf4755a400ab077dbc37c0b6.poster.avif?t=1755502708\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/7728db54bf4755a400ab077dbc37c0b6.webm?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/7728db54bf4755a400ab077dbc37c0b6.mp4?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Machines will try to stop you. Dodge their bullets and destroy them. F*ck SpaceCorp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/f6298c3be984441fee27b57ce03309f7.poster.avif?t=1755502708\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/f6298c3be984441fee27b57ce03309f7.webm?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/f6298c3be984441fee27b57ce03309f7.mp4?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive incremental progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Zones with unique enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills by completing tasks and destroying SpaceCorp Machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ upgrades to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and intense experience (~5.0hr playtime).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our server Discord, so you can stay tuned and give us feedback. You can find the link of the sidebar!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Prospector is an <strong>incremental bullet hell </strong>about mining cofferoids and fighting the evil SpaceCorp. <strong>Collect</strong> resources, <strong>upgrade</strong> your ship and <strong>become</strong> unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine cofferoids from SpaceCorp's fields and steal their AstroCoffee seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/d50ec75ae6be3a923fdb727ccab4c542.poster.avif?t=1755502708\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/d50ec75ae6be3a923fdb727ccab4c542.webm?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/d50ec75ae6be3a923fdb727ccab4c542.mp4?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and upgrade the skill tree to increase your ship power.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/7728db54bf4755a400ab077dbc37c0b6.poster.avif?t=1755502708\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/7728db54bf4755a400ab077dbc37c0b6.webm?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/7728db54bf4755a400ab077dbc37c0b6.mp4?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Machines will try to stop you. Dodge their bullets and destroy them. F*ck SpaceCorp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/f6298c3be984441fee27b57ce03309f7.poster.avif?t=1755502708\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/f6298c3be984441fee27b57ce03309f7.webm?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503440/extras/f6298c3be984441fee27b57ce03309f7.mp4?t=1755502708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive incremental progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Zones with unique enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills by completing tasks and destroying SpaceCorp Machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ upgrades to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and intense experience (~5.0hr playtime).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our server Discord, so you can stay tuned and give us feedback. You can find the link of the sidebar!</p>",
